{"id":"terriblemente","lemma":"terriblemente","pos":"adv","rank":2867,"glosses":["terribly"],"ipa":"/teˌribleˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Este año ha sido terriblemente caluroso.","en":"This year has been terribly hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/871878","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"very hot"}]},{"text":"Algo ha salido terriblemente mal.","en":"Something has gone terribly wrong.","words":[{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"sticking out"},null,{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}]},{"text":"Él estaba terriblemente emocionado.","en":"He was very excited.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449812","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"excited"}]},{"text":"Estoy terriblemente cansada.","en":"I'm incredibly tired.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"tired, weary, wearied","l":"cansado"}]},{"text":"Mira, estoy terriblemente ocupado.","en":"Look, I'm extremely busy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915804","words":[{"g":"target"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"occupied"}]}]}